msgid "ReliefMail 证书与连接排查"
msgstr "ReliefMail Certificate and Connection Troubleshooting"

msgid ""
"添加普通邮箱时，账户“高级”页的“自定义 CA 文件（可选）”留空。 ReliefMail 使用 ``/etc/ssl/certs/ca-"
"certificates.crt``，并校验服务器证书链、域名和有效期。 企业或自建邮箱的私有 CA 文件由管理员提供，按账户单独选择。"
msgstr ""
"For an ordinary email account, leave Optional Custom CA File blank on the "
"account's Advanced page. ReliefMail uses ``/etc/ssl/certs/ca-"
"certificates.crt`` and validates the server's certificate chain, hostname, "
"and validity period. Private CA files for corporate or self-hosted mail are "
"supplied by the administrator and selected separately per account."

msgid "修复或更新系统证书"
msgstr "Repairing or Updating System Certificates"

msgid "账户“高级”页提供“修复或更新系统证书”。使用默认 CA 的连接测试遇到证书库加载 失败或信任链错误时，也可从错误对话框进入修复。"
msgstr ""
"The account's Advanced page provides Repair or Update System Certificates. "
"If a connection test using the default CA encounters a certificate-store "
"loading failure or trust-chain error, the error dialog also provides access "
"to repair."

msgid "该入口启动 ``reliefapk --repair-ca``："
msgstr "This entry launches ``reliefapk --repair-ca``:"

msgid ""
"检查证书恢复条件；系统 CA 可用时，在线模拟固定证书包的变更。 恢复计划会说明两个 CA 包的 world 请求将刷新为不带版本或仓库标签约束的包名；"
" 使用已配置的默认签名仓库，其他请求保留。"
msgstr ""
"Check certificate restoration prerequisites. If the system CA is usable, "
"simulate changes to the fixed certificate packages online. The restoration "
"plan explains that world requests for the two CA packages will be refreshed "
"to plain package names without version or repository-tag constraints. The "
"configured default signed repository is used; other requests are preserved."

msgid "在 ReliefAPK 中检查变更并应用，使用其现有 sudo/root 密码认证。"
msgstr ""
"Review and apply changes in ReliefAPK, using its existing sudo/root password"
" authentication."

msgid ""
"系统 CA 不可用时，先原子恢复随系统分发的证书库，将原有常规文件保留为 权限 ``0600`` 的独立备份。随后才进行在线包可用性检查和真实 apk "
"模拟。"
msgstr ""
"If the system CA is unusable, first atomically restore the certificate store"
" distributed with the system, retaining the original regular file as a "
"separate backup with permissions ``0600``. Only then check online package "
"availability and run the actual apk simulation."

msgid ""
"apk 使用已配置的软件源和包签名验证获取固定的 ``ca-certificates`` 与 ``ca-certificates-bundle`` "
"软件包。先用 ``add --upgrade`` 更新 两个请求及其版本，再用 ``fix --reinstall`` "
"修复源文件和生成文件。每次真实变更前 均重新模拟，依赖仍由 apk 求解。HTTPS 源必须通过 TLS 证书验证；管理员配置的本地或 HTTP "
"源也必须通过 apk 签名验证。"
msgstr ""
"apk obtains the fixed ``ca-certificates`` and ``ca-certificates-bundle`` "
"packages using configured repositories and package-signature verification. "
"It first uses ``add --upgrade`` to update both requests and their versions, "
"then ``fix --reinstall`` to repair source and generated files. Each actual "
"change is preceded by another simulation, with dependencies still resolved "
"by apk. HTTPS repositories must pass TLS certificate validation; "
"administrator-configured local or HTTP repositories must also pass apk "
"signature verification."

msgid ""
"安装后重新解析证书库；文件仍不可用、新生成 ``.apk-new`` 或 apk 报告 ``APK unavailable, skipped`` "
"时报告失败，不把退出码 0 当作实际执行的充分证据。"
msgstr ""
"After installation, parse the certificate store again. If it remains "
"unusable, a new ``.apk-new`` appears, or apk reports ``APK unavailable, "
"skipped``, report failure; exit code 0 alone is insufficient evidence that "
"the operation actually ran."

msgid "返回 ReliefMail，重新输入测试所需的邮箱授权码并测试连接。"
msgstr ""
"Return to ReliefMail, reenter the mail authorization code needed for "
"testing, and test the connection."

msgid ""
"证书修复不会发送邮件。邮箱密码与系统提权密码分别由两个程序处理，不通过启动 参数传递。账户已指定私有 CA 时，应检查该文件，不会自动替换为公共 CA。"
msgstr ""
"Certificate repair sends no email. The mail password and system elevation "
"password are handled by separate programs and are not passed in launch "
"arguments. If an account specifies a private CA, inspect that file; it is "
"not automatically replaced with a public CA."

msgid ""
"下载使用当前有效的系统证书库；文件缺失或损坏时，使用随 ReliefOS 分发、 由 root 管理的 "
"``/usr/share/reliefos/certs/ca-certificates.crt`` 恢复系统证书库。 恢复文件及其父目录必须由 root"
" 拥有、不可由组或其他用户写入，且不能是符号链接。 预览阶段说明恢复计划，不修改系统证书。经认证应用后才恢复文件并进行在线模拟； "
"恢复后的网络或签名检查失败时保留已恢复的出厂 CA，并明确报告更新失败。 预览与实际修复禁用磁盘缓存；检查包可用性时仅请求元数据，不下载归档。 "
"固定修复工作程序启动 apk 时使用独立的最小环境，忽略调用者的 ``APK_CONFIG``、代理和 TLS 环境变量，也不加载全局 "
"``/etc/apk/config``，防止配置关闭签名或证书验证。 APK 输出中的仓库 URL 会隐藏，避免将可能包含的仓库凭据写入操作日志。 "
"软件源、签名密钥与架构仍使用系统配置；仅依靠环境变量配置代理的网络需要管理员 先提供可直接访问的软件源。 邮箱连接仍按账户配置验证。apk "
"当前下载库优先读取编译时指定的 CA 文件， 恢复过程直接修复该系统文件，不依赖环境变量覆盖该路径。 在线操作前和安装后均检查系统 CA "
"文件及其父目录的信任条件。即使 PEM 可以解析， 符号链接、非 root 属主或组/其他用户可写的路径也会被拒绝。管理员应先核对来源， 恢复 root"
" 拥有的常规文件和安全权限；程序不会把这种文件直接用作特权下载的信任锚。"
msgstr ""
"Downloads use the currently valid system certificate store. If it is missing"
" or damaged, restore it from the root-managed "
"``/usr/share/reliefos/certs/ca-certificates.crt`` distributed with ReliefOS."
" The restoration file and its parent directories must be root-owned, not "
"group- or other-writable, and not symbolic links. Preview explains the "
"restoration plan without changing certificates. Only authenticated "
"application restores the file and runs online simulation. If subsequent "
"network or signature checks fail, the restored factory CA is retained and "
"update failure is explicitly reported. Preview and actual repair disable "
"disk caches; package availability checks request metadata only, without "
"downloading archives. The fixed repair worker launches apk with a separate "
"minimal environment, ignoring the caller's ``APK_CONFIG``, proxy, and TLS "
"environment variables and not loading global ``/etc/apk/config``, preventing"
" configuration from disabling signature or certificate verification. "
"Repository URLs in APK output are hidden to avoid logging embedded "
"repository credentials. Repositories, signing keys, and architecture still "
"use system configuration. Networks configured for proxies only through "
"environment variables require administrators to first provide directly "
"reachable repositories. Mail connections still validate according to account"
" settings. apk's current download library prioritizes its compile-time CA "
"file; restoration repairs that system file directly rather than relying on "
"an environment override. Trust conditions for the system CA file and its "
"parents are checked before online operations and after installation. Even "
"parsable PEM is rejected if paths are symbolic links, not root-owned, or "
"writable by group/others. Administrators must verify provenance and restore "
"root-owned regular files with safe permissions first; such unsafe files are "
"not directly used as trust anchors for privileged downloads."

msgid ""
"``reliefos-trust`` 同时提供恢复证书库和 ``/etc/apk/protected_paths.d/reliefos-ca-"
"bundle.list``。apk 3 的文件替换保护按目录生效； 该规则把 ``/etc/ssl/certs`` "
"作为生成的证书输出目录，允许签名证书包替换损坏的已安装 文件，避免仅生成 ``.apk-new`` 而留下错误文件。私有 CA 源文件宜保存在 "
"``/usr/local/share/ca-certificates``，账户专用文件可放在其他适当目录。"
msgstr ""
"``reliefos-trust`` supplies both the restoration certificate store and "
"``/etc/apk/protected_paths.d/reliefos-ca-bundle.list``. apk 3 replacement "
"protection operates by directory. This rule treats ``/etc/ssl/certs`` as "
"generated certificate output, allowing signed certificate packages to "
"replace damaged installed files rather than merely producing ``.apk-new`` "
"and leaving broken files. Private CA sources should be stored in "
"``/usr/local/share/ca-certificates``; account-specific files can use other "
"appropriate directories."

msgid ""
"更新已有系统时，应同步更新 ReliefMail、ReliefAPK 和系统信任包/配置。仅复制新程序 到旧镜像，可能缺少恢复证书文件或 apk "
"保护规则；应检查安装日志及 ``.apk-new``。 自定义保护策略仍需由管理员合并；修复程序会检查最终证书文件是否可解析。 不能只更新汇总包： "
"`Alpine 的安装钩子 "
"<https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/3.24-stable/main/ca-"
"certificates/ca-certificates.trigger>`_ 会执行 ``update-ca-certificates``，按源文件 "
"重新生成证书库。仅替换汇总文件可能被旧源集合覆盖；所以修复流程同步维护两个包， 并移除它们在旧镜像中遗留的精确 world 约束，允许后续安全更新。"
msgstr ""
"When updating existing systems, update ReliefMail, ReliefAPK, and system "
"trust packages/configuration together. Copying only new programs into an old"
" image may omit restoration certificates or apk protection rules; inspect "
"installation logs and ``.apk-new``. Administrators still need to merge "
"custom protection policies; the repair tool checks that the final "
"certificate file parses. Updating only the bundle package is insufficient: "
"`Alpine's installation hook "
"<https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/3.24-stable/main/ca-"
"certificates/ca-certificates.trigger>`_ runs ``update-ca-certificates`` to "
"regenerate the store from source files. Replacing the bundle alone may be "
"undone by the old source set. Repair therefore maintains both packages and "
"removes their legacy exact world constraints to allow future security "
"updates."

msgid "按实际原因处理"
msgstr "Addressing the Actual Cause"

msgid "提示：系统 CA 文件不可用; 应检查的内容：文件是否存在、可读、完整，必要时使用修复入口。"
msgstr ""
"Message: System CA file unavailable; Check: existence, readability, and "
"integrity; use repair if needed."

msgid "提示：自定义 CA 文件不可用; 应检查的内容：文件路径、权限和 PEM 内容，或留空使用系统证书。"
msgstr ""
"Message: Custom CA file unavailable; Check: path, permissions, and PEM "
"contents, or leave blank to use system certificates."

msgid "提示：服务器证书链不受信任; 应检查的内容：服务器地址、中间证书链、私有 CA 选择，以及系统根证书是否需要更新。"
msgstr ""
"Message: Server certificate chain untrusted; Check: server address, "
"intermediate chain, private CA selection, and whether system roots need "
"updating."

msgid "提示：证书已过期或尚未生效; 应检查的内容：系统日期、时间和服务器证书有效期。"
msgstr ""
"Message: Certificate expired or not yet valid; Check: system date/time and "
"server certificate validity period."

msgid "提示：域名不匹配; 应检查的内容：IMAP/SMTP 主机名与服务器证书是否相符。"
msgstr ""
"Message: Hostname mismatch; Check: whether IMAP/SMTP hostnames match the "
"server certificate."

msgid "提示：TLS 协商失败; 应检查的内容：端口、隐式 TLS/STARTTLS 选择、网络状态与双方协议支持。"
msgstr ""
"Message: TLS negotiation failed; Check: port, implicit TLS/STARTTLS choice, "
"network status, and protocol support at both ends."

msgid ""
"CA 包中部分证书无法解析时，只要有可用根证书，程序会继续用这些根验证服务器； 服务器身份、有效期和信任链校验仍为必需。全部证书不可用时拒绝连接。 "
"诊断保留失败阶段、TLS 返回码、校验标志和系统时间，便于区分原因。"
msgstr ""
"If some certificates in a CA bundle cannot be parsed, the program continues "
"using any usable roots to validate the server. Server identity, validity, "
"and trust-chain checks remain mandatory. If no certificates are usable, the "
"connection is refused. Diagnostics retain the failure stage, TLS return "
"code, verification flags, and system time to distinguish causes."

msgid "定向验证"
msgstr "Targeted Verification"

msgid ""
"QEMU 工具 ``tools/test_reliefmail_ca_qemu.py`` 使用独立磁盘副本及临时签名仓库， 测试 CA "
"损坏后的可见错误与修复流程。测试 CA、仓库密钥和账户均为夹具， 不会安装到宿主系统或生产输入镜像中。"
msgstr ""
"The QEMU tool ``tools/test_reliefmail_ca_qemu.py`` uses an independent disk "
"copy and temporary signed repository to test visible errors and repair after"
" CA corruption. Test CAs, repository keys, and accounts are fixtures and are"
" not installed on the host or into the production input image."
